ES:
Nosotros no tenemos ninguna
ordenanza ahora mismo en el
pueblo, {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿verdad?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Por un lado, se siente uno muy libre.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pero en parte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} parece un poco una
oportunidad desaprovechada,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¿no?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}O igual significa que el pueblo va
tan bien que no las necesita.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
Gibt es in deiner Stadt{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
irgendwelche {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Verordnungen{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Bei uns nicht!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Na,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} die Herrschaften im Rathaus
werden sich schon was dabei
denken.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Zumindest hoffe ich das...

EN:
Right now,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}that {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Early Bird{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
ordinance is in effect, right?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}It's so rough for us night owls!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Still,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I guess by waking up early
now,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}I realize just how long a single
day can be,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

Right now, the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Early Bird{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ordinance{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
is in effect in our town.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I suppose the stores opening earlier
is pretty convenient for those guys
who rise with the sun, yeah?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}It's a pain for me{{TAG:0003:0021:}} since I want to
sleep till noon, though.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
Se aprobó una ordenanza en el
pueblo que se llama {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}A madrugar{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Las tiendas abren más temprano
y tal.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Supongo que le va bien a los
que se levantan cuando sale el sol.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}A mí me mata,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} porque yo si pudiera{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
me levantaba a mediodía.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
Al momento, nella nostra città,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
è in vigore l'ordinanza {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Città
mattiniera{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi sa che aprire prima i negozi
conviene a quei tizi che si svegliano
presto e sono iperattivi al mattino.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Per me è una fregatura, però,{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
visto che mi piace dormire fino
a mezzogiorno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
Şu anda kasabamızda {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Erkenci Kuş{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
yönetmeliği{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} yürürlükte.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Güneşle kalkanlar
için dükkânların erken açılması bayağı
kullanışlıdır herhâlde, ha? {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ama ben{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
öğlene kadar uyumak istediğim için sinir
bozucu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Grazie a quell'ordinanza {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Città
nottambula {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}che hai messo in vigore,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
c'è un sacco di vita di notte!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}E poi ci sono io che faccio le ronde
notturne! Non c'è da preoccuparsi
per la sicurezza!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Seit diese {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Nachteulenverordnung
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}in Kraft ist, treibt sich hier allerlei
lichtscheues Gesindel herum!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Was hast du dir dabei gedacht?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Aber kein Problem, ich behalte euch
alle im Auge...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}BWA HA HA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Thanks to the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Night Owl{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ordinance,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
shops are open until late at night.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I'm really grateful for that!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Although, those fellows who'd
normally be asleep by nighttime
are still up being annoying. {{TAG:0003:001B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Gah!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Gece Kuşu{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} yönetmeliği sayesinde{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
dükkânlar gece geç saate kadar açık.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Buna gerçekten minnettarım! {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Gerçi
normalde gece uyumuş olacak tipler hâlâ
ayakta dolaşıp sinir bozuyor. {{TAG:0003:001B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Gah!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}I bet even if the shops in your town
are closed,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ours are still open!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Thanks to the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Night Owl{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ordinance,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
we keep everything open late!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Seguro que cuando las tiendas
de tu pueblo ya han cerrado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
aquí siguen abiertas.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¡Es por la ordenanza {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Vida nocturna{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Senin kasabada dükkânlar kapansa bile{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
bizimkiler hâlâ açıktır!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Gece Kuşu{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
yönetmeliği sayesinde{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} her şeyi geç saate
kadar açık tutuyoruz!

ES:
No sé si te has dado cuenta{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Por culpa de una ordenanza de esas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
aquí está todo muy caro estos días.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Por otro lado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} la tienda de reciclaje
también paga más de lo normal.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Cuando tengas cosas que vender,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¡aprovecha y véndelas aquí!

Parece que últimamente hay menos
basura y malas hierbas. Tampoco{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
veo flores secas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿puede ser?
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}¿Es por esa ordenanza {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Como una
patena{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} que aprobaste?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Pues está quedando el pueblo
precioso!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Qué bien{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}, con la ordenanza
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Como una patena{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
está más presentable que nunca.
Lo que ya no sé{{TAG:0003:000F:}} es cómo tendrá
cada uno su casa.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Espero que se
estén esmerando!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Faut bien l'avouer, l'arrêté sur
l'{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}entretien du charme {{TAG:000E:000A:0600640065002000040064002700}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}aura servi à quelque chose !
C'est tout propre,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} on pourrait
manger par terre !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Sans citer de noms,{{TAG:0003:000F:}} c'est plus
propre dehors que chez certains !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ultimamente, grazie all'ordinanza
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Abbelliamo la città{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
sembra molto più pulita.
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Però non so se si può dire lo stesso
delle case degli altri!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bisogna tenere
sempre casa pulita!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
